  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community-based Climate Change Resilience and Green Transition (COMRES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to the Government of Azerbaijans efforts to build a green, sustainable, and inclusive economy while fostering resilient, gender-equal, and community-driven development. Focused on the climate-vulnerable Aran region, the project helps in addressing the critical socio-economic and environmental challenges faced by local communities and MSMEs, especially in agriculture, which is vital for the region&#x2019;s economy yet highly susceptible to climate risks such as droughts and floods.</narrative>
  </description>
